","content":"**Description** — what happened, where, and how it affected you. At least\n10 characters, up to 5,000."},"54":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-28","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#describe-what-happened","content":"Write the description in your own words and include anything that would help\nsomeone find the problem: a place name, a date, a reference number. An officer\nwho has never been to the location will be reading this."},"55":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-29","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"Choice"},"56":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-30","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"What happens"},"57":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-31","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"**Stay anonymous**"},"58":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-32","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"Your complaint is handled without any contact details. Nobody can call you for more information, and you will not be notified when it is resolved."},"59":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-33","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"**I want updates**"},"60":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-34","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"You give a phone number or email, and you can be contacted about progress and the outcome."},"61":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-35","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"**Stay anonymous** is selected by default. Either way you still get a tracking\ncode, and you can still check the status yourself at any time."},"62":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-36","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"Click **Submit Complaint** to finish."},"63":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-37","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#after-you-submit","content":"You are shown a **tracking code** that looks like `RDAP-260907-6503`."},"64":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-38","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#after-you-submit","content":"Write this code down or take a photograph of the screen before you close the\npage. If you chose to stay anonymous, this code is the **only** way to check\nyour complaint later — it cannot be recovered or sent to you again."},"65":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-39","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#after-you-submit","content":"Then see Check a complaint."},"66":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-40","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**The Next button stays grey.** A required field on that step is still\nempty. On step 1 you need both a category and an issue type; on step 3 the\ndescription must be at least 10 characters."},"67":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-41","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Your location is not in the list.** Choose the closest area above it and\nname the exact place in the description instead."},"68":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-42","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**You closed the page mid-way.** Nothing is saved until you press\n**Submit Complaint**, so start again from the beginning."},"69":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"page","content":"Check a complaint","breadcrumbs":["Docs","For the public","For the public"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track"},"70":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-0","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track","content":"Use your tracking code to see the current status. No account or password needed."},"71":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-1","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#type-in-your-tracking-code","content":"Type in your tracking code"},"72":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-2","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#click-track-complaint","content":"Click Track Complaint"},"73":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-3","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"What the statuses mean"},"74":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-4","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-you-will-and-will-not-see","content":"What you will and will not see"},"75":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-5","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"76":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-6","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track","content":"Open **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal/track**,\nor click **Track** in the top menu."},"77":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-7","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#type-in-your-tracking-code","content":"This is the code you were given when you submitted, in the form\n`RDAP-260907-6503`. Type it exactly, including the dashes."},"78":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-8","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#click-track-complaint","content":"You are shown the current status, the category, and the date you submitted it."},"79":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-9","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"Status"},"80":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-10","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"What it means for you"},"81":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-11","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"**New**"},"82":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-12","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"Received, waiting for an officer to review it."},"83":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-13","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"**In Progress**"},"84":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-14","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"Assigned to an officer who is working on it."},"85":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-15","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"**Resolved**"},"86":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-16","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"The officer has recorded an outcome."},"87":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-17","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"**Closed**"},"88":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-18","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"Finished and filed."},"89":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-19","page_id":"/docs/citizen/tr