, users, and system\nsettings. You will only be able to open the ones your role allows."},"594":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-25","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Your name and email are shown at the bottom-left. Click there to sign out."},"595":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-26","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"The staff screens display in **Kinyarwanda**, because that is the language\nthis system is set to. The Screen labels page lists every\nlabel you will meet with its English meaning. If you would rather work in\nEnglish, ask your administrator to set the language on your own account — it\nchanges only what you see, not what anyone else sees."},"596":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-27","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Roles in eGRM are about **duties**, and most staff hold several at once. What\nactually differs between two officers is usually the **region** they are\nassigned to, not the buttons they can press."},"597":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-28","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"If your job is…"},"598":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-29","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Read"},"599":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-30","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Taking complaints from the public and entering them"},"600":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-31","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Field Officer"},"601":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-32","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"te